{"title":"Repair night","genre":"design","brief":"Design an offline welcome and wayfinding kit for the first Repair Night at a neighborhood hall. Doors at 17:30, last intake 19:15. Registration is by the west entrance; electronics is in the back room, sewing by the stage, refreshments in the courtyard. The accessible entrance is on Pine Street. Volunteers need something usable at the door and attendees need to find their way. Choose the medium, assets, and organization yourself.","works":{"d1936981be0f0ea3":{"files":[{"name":"01 - Volunteer door card.pdf","bytes":3213,"sha256":"8bad75640e159c0108518493c20ba40ff354a7ffd0d1c39d18cbc66d652dec60","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/8bad75640e159c0108518493c20ba40ff354a7ffd0d1c39d18cbc66d652dec60-page1.jpg"},{"name":"02 - Take-along guide (cut in half).pdf","bytes":3805,"sha256":"5bef5f00d16cb84c65954d9726fc4094499989102fbee98723d04907811593f7","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/5bef5f00d16cb84c65954d9726fc4094499989102fbee98723d04907811593f7-page1.jpg"},{"name":"03 - Entrance and station signs.pdf","bytes":8929,"sha256":"e292d711bb3e345e9169cb062a442fdba0957fcc88fee4566b65e2dc8036c68d","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/e292d711bb3e345e9169cb062a442fdba0957fcc88fee4566b65e2dc8036c68d-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/e75b41a129f2e387c140500071daafbc2a55ef339d04f0299c70abbb03df1487.zip"},"3ff8d249c29a0258":{"files":[{"name":"Door Volunteer Guide.pdf","bytes":27378,"sha256":"e9529d35f02fb96f71dd47e752dea30a2d4604bdfd0ced3ce17dced841119ff6","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/e9529d35f02fb96f71dd47e752dea30a2d4604bdfd0ced3ce17dced841119ff6-page1.jpg"},{"name":"Wayfinding Signs.pdf","bytes":17301,"sha256":"cb70d37bbdae2dc337da770f482737c5e5193b78f96573e6c87f6d7a37671606","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/cb70d37bbdae2dc337da770f482737c5e5193b78f96573e6c87f6d7a37671606-page1.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome.pdf","bytes":30915,"sha256":"88f47fd0c40b76d721200008864af707ec5657b6c86f5